# OpenABL release staged on every image (BOOT/openabl/), the same for every SoC.
# Upstream: https://github.com/OpenHandheldCollective/OpenABL (GPL-3.0-or-later).
# OpenABL-PB is PB-OS's own build, from the fork (project-barry/OpenABL), with the
# version of the OpenABL it is based on: upstream v1.2 plus the SM7750 (Retroid
# Pocket Duo), its own name, and the rest of the fix for the logo hang between
# ExitBootServices and the kernel (upstream issue OpenHandheldCollective/OpenABL#29).
# PBOS_ABL_NAME is the release's name everywhere (releases.tsv, the PB-OS tab).
# The fork's older v1.2 release (upstream v1.1 plus that fix) is "1.2" in
# releases.tsv.
# TO FILL IN when the release exists: the tag (with "pb" and the version in it;
# its files are openabl-<tag>.tar.gz and openabl-<tag>-source.tar.xz), the
# tarball's hash, the three rows in releases.tsv, and payloads.pin. Until then
# only test images build (make-steamos-sm8650.sh --help).
# A new release: the one before it stays in releases.tsv and its payloads go into
# MENUS in pbos-qam/daemon/notices.cpp, or the PB-OS tab won't offer the new one
# over it (the image build checks that).
PBOS_ABL_NAME="OpenABL-PB 1.2"
PBOS_ABL_REPO=project-barry/OpenABL
PBOS_ABL_TAG=UNFILLED
PBOS_ABL_TARBALL_SHA256=UNFILLED
